attempt is made.

@deftp {GOOPS method} live-properties resource
@emph{Must} return a list of pairs of xml elements and live property
objects. The method @emph{should} merge these with properties from its
parent class. If the same property appears multiple times, then the
earliest instance is chosen.

@example
(append (list (cons ((xml 'ns 'tag))
                    (make-live-property getter setter remover)))
        (next-method))
@end example

See @ref{Default Live Properties} for the live properties defined by
base resource, and which of those need to be implemented by the
extending resources.
@end deftp

@deftp {Exception type} protected-property
Error type to be thrown when a resource is protected from
modification. Has no argument, meaning the surrounding code should
keep track of the property trying to be modified.
@end deftp

@deftp {GOOPS method} dead-properties resource
@emph{Must} return a list of xml elements, one for each dead property.
@end deftp

@deftp {GOOPS method} get-dead-property resource key
Must return a @code{propstat} object, meaning that
@code{(propstat 404 (list @var{key}))} @emph{must} be the return value if
the property doesn't exist.

@var{key} is an xml object, whose contents and attributes should be
ignored.
@end deftp

@deftp {GOOPS method} set-dead-property!! resource value
Run pre-condition for setting the property, and returns a thunk which,
when evaluated, actually sets the property.
@end deftp

@deftp {GOOPS method} remove-dead-property!! resource key
@end deftp
